# Build outputs
**/target
**/*.class
**/*.jar

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.iml
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.classpath

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak

# Documentation (not needed in build context)
**/README*
**/LICENSE
**/NOTICE

# Dev/CI configs
**/.travis.yml
**/.github
**/.devcontainer
**/*.md

# Veai
**/.veai

# Docker files (avoid recursive context)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/.dockerignore
